TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    Raw Cloudflare GraphQL analytics responses for the pollinations.ai zone, one row per UTC
    date, appended daily by .github/workflows/data-sync-cloudflare-traffic-tinybird.yml. The
    Free plan keeps per-request detail for 30 days only, so body is stored exactly as returned
    for later analysis. Dataset page_views: HTML responses to real clients on our own page
    routes of pollinations.ai, www and enter, by page, country, device, browser and verified
    bot category. Counts are Cloudflare's sampled estimates.

SCHEMA >
    `dataset` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.dataset`,
    `date` Date `json:$.date`,
    `fetched_at` DateTime `json:$.fetched_at`,
    `body` String `json:$.body`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "dataset, date, fetched_at"
